    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Bennetts Auctioneers are delighted to bring No. 23 Malone Gardens to the market. Perfectly situated on this quiet residential road minutes from the villages of Sandymount and Ringsend. Features of the property include GFCH, double glazed window and private rear garden. The accommodation of c. 76 sq. m. briefly compromises of entrance hallway, living room, kitchen/ dining room and bathroom on the ground floor. Two bedrooms on the first floor complete the property.\r\nExternally, to the front there is a small, railed garden laid out in lawn. \r\nTo the rear a fair sized private garden laid out in stone.\r\n\r\nLocation\r\n\r\nNo. 23 is located within walking distance of all amenities including multiple award-winning restaurants, boutique shops, pubs and an abundance of sports and fitness clubs. Adjacent to the Aviva stadium and RDS and within walking distance of Sandymount and Ballsbridge villages and all they have to offer. The IFSC, Facebook and Google are all within walking distance, as is Sandymount strand and Herbert Park. The area is very well served by multiple bus routes and within walking distance of Lansdowne and Grand Canal DART stations. The East link Bridge is a few minutes away by car and the Dublin airport is only 20 minutes’ drive via the port tunnel."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor\r\n\r\nEntrance hallway:  1.69m 1.39m  wood flooring  \r\n\r\nLiving room:  5.07m x 3.30m  wood flooring, coving, feature fireplace with gas insert, window to front  \r\n\r\nKitchen/ Dining room:  5.77m x 4.26m  wood flooring, range of floor and eye level units, tiled splashback, fully plumbed for washer/dryer, stainless steel sink, door or rear garden \r\n\r\nBathroom:  2.34m x 1.50m  tiled throughout, walk in shower unit, W.C.,W.H.B., window to rear\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nLanding:  2.07m x 2.20m  carpet flooring  \r\n\r\nBedroom 1:  3.82m x4.26m  carpet flooring, feature fireplace, built in wardrobes, window to front \r\n\r\nBedroom 2:  3.20m x 4.26m  carpet flooring, built in wardrobe, window to rear  \r\n\r\nTotal floor area: c.76 sq. m\r\n\r\nExterior\r\n\r\nTo the front, a small, railed garden laid out in lawn with mature shrubbery.\r\n\r\nTo the rear, a fair sized private garden laid out in paving stone."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Charming two bedroom terraced home\r\n\r\nGas fired central heating and double glazed windows throughout\r\n\r\nIdeal location just off Bath Avenue in this highly sought-after area\r\n\r\nExcellent opportunity to extend subject to P.P\r\n\r\nClose to Aviva Stadium, RDS, Silicon Docks, and Google\r\n\r\nTotal floor area of c. 76 sq. m."
      },
